            <ArticleTitle>How to write a medical CV.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e32</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/IJ9.0000000000000032</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A medical curriculum vitae remains an important document that has 2 main roles: to distinguish candidates applying for various positions, whether that be jobs, posts, grants and it provides a means of keeping an up-to-date record of all your achievements and skills gained thus far. This article provides detailed guidance on how to structure an effective curriculum vitae to maximize your chances of success when applying for these positions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
